  "body": "### How license meets inclusion principles\n\nIncluded in Debian and Fedora as part of the `gnu-efi` package.\n\n### License Name\n\nBSD-2-Clause - Linaro variant\n\n### Suggested short identifier\n\nBSD-2-Clause-Linaro\n\n### License or Exception?\n\nlicense\n\n### URL to license text\n\nhttps://github.com/PicoEFI/PicoEFI/blob/trunk/LICENSES/LicenseRef-scancode-bsd-no-disclaimer-unmodified.txt\n\n### OSI Status\n\nI don't know\n\n### License author or steward\n\nUnknown\n\n### URL to project(s) that use license\n\nhttps://github.com/PicoEFI/PicoEFI\nhttps://github.com/Limine-Bootloader/Limine\nhttps://github.com/ncroxon/gnu-efi\n\n### paste text of license here\n\n ```\nRedistribution and use in source and binary forms, with or without\n modification, are permitted provided that the following conditions\n are met:\n 1. Redistributions of source code must retain the above copyright\n    notice and this list of conditions, without modification.\n 2. The name of the author may not be used to endorse or promote products\n    derived from this software without specific prior written permission.\n```",
